  "notes": [
    "Snapshot taken as October 1990, just after German reunification: Bulgaria is still the People's Republic (renamed 15 Nov 1990) with the 1971–1990 flag; Mozambique (renamed 30 Nov 1990) keeps its implicit self since its flag was unchanged.",
    "Lithuania, Latvia, Estonia (declared independence Mar-May 1990) and Armenia (renamed Republic of Armenia, Aug 1990) are labelled by plain name inside USSR; Moldova as 'SSR of Moldova' (renamed June 1990). Georgia renamed only on 14 Nov 1990 and Kirghizia on 15 Dec 1990, so they keep SSR labels.",
    "Kuwait (Iraqi occupation Aug 1990–Feb 1991) is drawn as a contested polity (KW_OCCUPIED, Kuwait's flag) rather than as part of Iraq, since the annexation was never recognised. Alternative: 'IQ_1963|Kuwait Governorate'.",
    "PS is drawn as contested 'Israeli-occupied territories' with Israel's flag (no Palestinian Authority until 1994).",
    "Marshall Islands and Micronesia left as modern selves (free association since 1986; UN trusteeship formally ended 22 Dec 1990). Palau stays in the Trust Territory until 1994.",
    "Walvis Bay (South African until 1994) and the South African homelands are not separate units and are left with Namibia/South Africa.",
    "GB_EMPIRE / PT_EMPIRE names ('British Empire', 'Portuguese Empire') are anachronistic for 1990 but are reused per the canonical ids; labels carry Hong Kong / Macau.",
    "Polity ids reconciled with the 1976/1993 fragments: TURKEY, SWAZILAND, ZAIRE, CG_PR, RW_1961, MM_1974, WESTERN_SAMOA, TIMOR_OCCUPIED, FR_EMPIRE; YEMEN_NORTH/YEMEN_SOUTH names match 1976.",
    "Minor flag variants included where Commons has a distinct file (Zambia 1964–96 shades, Oman 1970–95, Bahrain 1972–2002); skipped very minor ones (Qatar, Tunisia, Paraguay, Dominica, Falklands, Honduras shade).",
    "GS assigned to GB_EMPIRE because its own flag dates from 1999; TK assigned to NZ because Tokelau had no flag of its own until 2009.",
    "Saint Martin and Saint-Barthélemy were communes of Guadeloupe until 2007, so they share FR|Guadeloupe with FR-971 (assumes FR-971's implicit label is 'Guadeloupe' and implicit FR polity id is 'FR').",
    "Territory review: the metropoles of the two remaining colonial holdings (UK for Hong Kong and South Georgia, Portugal for Macau) are assigned to GB_EMPIRE / PT_EMPIRE with their own labels, as in the 1949 fragment, so colony and metropole share one polity; England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland are assigned explicitly to keep their labels. Crown dependencies and other British/French/Dutch territories keep their implicit modern selves, as their status in 1990 matched today's.",
    "ZA_1928 uses the dark-colours Commons file (1928-82 shade); the 1982-94 flag had a brighter blue (Flag_of_South_Africa_(1928–1994,_bright_colors).svg). Kept one id across eras as the difference is a shade only.",
    "Upper Volta became Burkina Faso with a new flag in 1984 and Burma became Myanmar in 1989; both show only through assignments (no event card) to stay within 8 events."
  ]
}
